    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.9]",
    "content" : "Independent study is designed to provide students with an opportunity to gain or enhance public health knowledge and to explore an area of interest related to public health research or the delivery and/or administration of health services. Instructions and forms required for registration (http://publichealth.gwu.edu/academics/forms/) are available Independent study projects may not be used as a substitute for an available required or elective course and may not cover substantially the same subject matter that is available in a required or elective course."
